        <p class="m-0 text-base-content/60">Our partner operators, with the terms we have verified. Offers appear only where available in your state.</p>
      </div>
      <span class="badge pending hidden sm:inline-block">Updated Sep 2026</span>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="card flex flex-col">
        <div class="card-head">
          <div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between">
            <i class="ph ph-coins text-3xl text-brand" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <span class="badge pending">Partner</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="!text-xl">Jackpota</h2>
          <p>Social casino with a large slot library. Redemption terms are not published publicly yet.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-foot mt-auto">
          <p>Verification: <span class="badge pending">Partial</span></p>
          <div class="cta-box !my-2 !border-0 !bg-transparent !p-0" data-cta-operator="jackpota">
            <p class="cta-msg text-sm">Check availability in your state to see the current offer.</p>
            <a class="cta-btn btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="/go/jackpota/">Visit Jackpota <i class="ph ph-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card flex flex-col">
        <div class="card-head">
          <div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between">
            <i class="ph ph-rabbit text-3xl text-brand" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <span class="badge pending">Partner</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="!text-xl">Lucky Bunny</h2>
          <p>Newer social casino on a dual-currency model, 21+. Terms are not publicly reachable yet.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-foot mt-auto">
          <p>Verification: <span class="badge pending">Partial</span></p>
          <div class="cta-box !my-2 !border-0 !bg-transparent !p-0" data-cta-operator="lucky-bunny">
            <p class="cta-msg text-sm">Check availability in your state to see the current offer.</p>
            <a class="cta-btn btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="/go/lucky-bunny/">Visit Lucky Bunny <i class="ph ph-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card flex flex-col">
        <div class="card-head">
          <div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between">
            <i class="ph ph-currency-btc text-3xl text-brand" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <span class="badge pending">Partner</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="!text-xl">YAY Casino</h2>
          <p>Crypto-only redemptions. Excludes WA, ID, CA, NY, MI. Run by Social Gaming LLC (Delaware).</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-foot mt-auto">
          <p>Verification: <span class="badge complete">Verified T&amp;C</span></p>
          <div class="cta-box !my-2 !border-0 !bg-transparent !p-0" data-cta-operator="yay-casino">
            <p class="cta-msg text-sm">Check availability in your state to see the current offer.</p>
            <a class="cta-btn btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="/go/yay-casino/">Visit YAY Casino <i class="ph ph-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card flex flex-col">
        <div class="card-head">
          <div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between">
            <i class="ph ph-treasure-chest text-3xl text-brand" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <span class="badge pending">Partner</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="!text-xl">Dorados</h2>
          <p>Minimum redemption 100 SC. Restricted in 14 states incl. CA, NY, MI, NV. Sponsor Rafflefy Ltd.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-foot mt-auto">
          <p>Verification: <span class="badge complete">Verified</span></p>
          <div class="cta-box !my-2 !border-0 !bg-transparent !p-0" data-cta-operator="dorados">
            <p class="cta-msg text-sm">Check availability in your state to see the current offer.</p>
            <a class="cta-btn btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="/go/dorados/">Visit Dorados <i class="ph ph-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card flex flex-col">
        <div class="card-head">
          <div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between">
            <i class="ph ph-sparkle text-3xl text-brand" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <span class="badge pending">Partner</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="!text-xl">Zonko</h2>
          <p>Newest US social casino. Restricted in 14 states incl. CA, NY, MI, NV. Gold Coin purchases.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-foot mt-auto">
          <p>Verification: <span class="badge complete">Terms only</span></p>
          <div class="cta-box !my-2 !border-0 !bg-transparent !p-0" data-cta-operator="zonko">
            <p class="cta-msg text-sm">Check availability in your state to see the current offer.</p>
            <a class="cta-btn btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="/go/zonko/">Visit Zonko <i class="ph ph-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card flex flex-col border-dashed">
        <div class="card-head">
          <div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between">
            <i class="ph ph-map-pin text-3xl text-base-content/50" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </div>
          <h2 class="!text-xl">Check your state first</h2>
          <p>Offers depend on where you play. Select your state to see which deals are available to you.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-foot mt-auto">
          <p><a class="text-brand no-underline hover:underline" href="#eligibility-heading">Select your state <i class="ph ph-arrow-down" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-base-content/50"><i class="ph ph-info" aria-hidden="true"></i> We may earn a commission on partner links, at no cost to you. It never changes a verified figure. <a class="text-brand" href="/disclosure/">How we're paid</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- Latest research -->
  <section class="py-10" aria-labelledby="latest-heading">
    <div class="mb-6 flex items-end justify-between gap-4">
      <h2 id="latest-heading" class="mb-0 mt-0 font-serif text-[2.05rem] font-semibold leading-tight text-base-content">Latest research</h2>
      <a class="text-brand no-underline hover:underline" href="/guides/">All guides <i class="ph ph-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {% for item in collections.guides | reverse | slice(0, 3) %}
      <a href="{{ item.url }}" class="card group no-underline transition hover:border-brand">
        <div class="card-head">
          <span class="badge {% if item.data.guideType == 'Benchmark' %}complete{% else %}pending{% endif %}">{{ item.data.guideType or "Article" }}</span>
          <h2 class="mt-3 !text-xl group-hover:text-brand">{{ item.data.title }}</h2>
          <p>{{ item.data.description }}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-foot mt-auto">
          <p><i class="ph ph-calendar-blank" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{ item.data.publishedAt | readableDate }}</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Redemption times table -->
  <section class="py-10" aria-labelledby="research-index">
    <h2 id="research-index" class="mb-4 mt-0 font-serif text-[2.05rem] font-semibold leading-tight text-base-content">Redemption times at five major operators</h2>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-head">
        <p>Official published terms, September 2026. Funded-test results in progress.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="table-scroll !mt-2 !border-t-0">
        <table class="data">
          <caption>Published redemption terms from operator terms of service. Observed columns are filled only after a funded test completes. <a href="/research/sweepstakes-casino-redemption-times/">Read the full article</a>.</caption>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th scope="col">Operator</th>
              <th scope="col">Published estimate</th>
              <th scope="col">Observed (funded test)</th>
              <th scope="col">Status</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {% for op in operators %}
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">{{ op.name }}</th>
              <td>{{ op.publishedEstimate }}</td>
              <td>{% if op.observedResult %}{{ op.observedResult }}{% else %}&mdash;{% endif %}</td>
              <td><span class="badge {{ op.testStatus }}">{% if op.testStatus == "pending" %}Pending{% elif op.testStatus == "completed" %}Completed{% else %}Not tested{% endif %}</span></td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class="card-foot">
        <p>Source: operator terms of service, access dates in the <a href="/research/sweepstakes-casino-redemption-times/#sources">article sources</a>.</p>
        <p>We do not publish a "fastest" ranking until at least three comparable funded tests have completed.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- State eligibility -->
  <section class="eligibility scroll-mt-20" aria-labelledby="eligibility-heading">
    <h2 id="eligibility-heading"><i class="ph ph-map-pin" aria-hidden="true"></i> Check availability in your state</h2>
    <p>All research on this site is public in every state. Commercial offers are shown only after you select a state, and never for states where the category is closed.</p>
    <div class="js-only">
      <label for="state-picker" class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold text-base-content/60">Your state</label>
      <select id="state-picker" data-state-picker>
        {% for s in states %}<option value="{{ s.code }}"{% if not s.code %} disabled selected{% endif %}>{{ s.name }}</option>{% endfor %}
      </select>
      <p class="eligibility-note">Stored on your device for 30 days. Nothing is sent to us. Current selection: <strong data-state-echo>not selected</strong>.</p>
    </div>
    <noscript><p class="eligibility-note">State selection requires JavaScript. The <a href="/availability/">state availability list</a> works without it.</p></noscript>
  </section>

  <!-- How this site works -->
  <section class="py-10" aria-labelledby="how-we-work">
    <h2 id="how-we-work" class="mb-4 mt-0 font-serif text-[2.05rem] font-semibold leading-tight text-base-content">How this site works</h2>
    <div class="signposts">
      <div class="signpost">
        <h3><i class="ph ph-flask text-brand" aria-hidden="true"></i> Methodology</h3>
        <p>How we fund accounts, time redemptions, label test status, and decide when a ranking is allowed to exist.</p>
        <p><a href="/methodology/">Read the methodology</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="signpost">
        <h3><i class="ph ph-map-trifold text-brand" aria-hidden="true"></i> State availability</h3>
        <p>Which states are open, which are closed by statute or enforcement, and when each rule last changed.</p>
        <p><a href="/availability/">Check your state</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="signpost">
        <h3><i class="ph ph-handshake text-brand" aria-hidden="true"></i> Disclosure</h3>
        <p>How we are paid, what affiliate links do and do not influence, and how the eligibility gate works.</p>
        <p><a href="/disclosure/">Read the disclosure</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="signpost">
        <h3><i class="ph ph-user text-brand" aria-hidden="true"></i> About the author</h3>
        <p>Alex Rowan researches and writes the redemption-time and payout coverage on this site.</p>
        <p><a href="/authors/alex-rowan/">About Alex Rowan</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>
</main>
